  "system": {
    "identifier": "jiton-magnet-release-imperial-dust-funeral",
    "description": "<p>Using your magnetism, you summon a wall of dust particles into existence at a point you choose within range. You can make the wave washing out from you in a 60-foot cone.</p>\n<p>When the wave forces all creatures within range to make a Strength saving throw, taking 4d8 earth damage and being Restrained, Weakened, Bruised and being pushed to the end of this jutsu’s affected area on a failure.</p>\n<p>Creatures Grappled or Restrained by a Jiton clan Hijutsu or clan feature you are used automatically fails their saving throw, and treats the damage you deal with this jutsu as if they are vulnerable to it.</p>\n<p>Once you cast this jutsu you cannot cast it again until the end of your following turn due to the strain it places on you.</p>",
